We're excited to announce an important patch for The Legacy Demo!

Thank you to everyone who leaves feedback on Steam and takes our short survey, we study every feedback in detail and improve the game for you.



[dynamiclink href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3112550/The_Legacy_Demo/"][/dynamiclink]

[img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45109069/add3429a4026677c3fd4b56ad833a3141ae250b8.png"][img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45109069/8afba5b654c5796f956186265725266756aa69c4.png"]

In this patch some things have been fixed, plus we added some very important things such as: an option to enable/disable the ability to revive after death, a slider to customize background sounds that were too loud in the background, added a lot of useful hints and more!



[img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45109069/d03043dc94984734c2421fd4c362c9f66d77d0ec.png"]
Changes:
Added a slider to customize ambient sounds; 

Removed headshots to the head from cold weapons, head damage is now ×3;

Putting on a mask now displays the effect on the screen;

Added a reset button for filters;

Updated the user interface of filters - it is now more user-friendly and clearer;

Added a hint on how to reanimate the player in the “Death” state UI;

More rocks have been added in the vicinity of Svetlograd;

More red barrels added to the map;

Day length increased to 40 minutes;

Fixed bugs with hands in night vision mode and underwater effect;

Added tooltip animation when opening inventory for the first time after picking up a book.

Replaced zombie, player and soldier background artwork in the vault;

Stove now displays a tooltip on how to fire it up;

Added in-game revival option;

Added a tooltip about green smoke defense;

Cargo loot has been rebalanced;

Inventory chat became more visible and readable;

Occasionally the snake would play the sound of a boar - Fixed;

Balanced vampire and witch health, now they are 10-15% harder to kill;

Added a few new screemer sounds;

In the starting control panel - Added information on how to get resources;

Fixed bugs in Dutch language.

